message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "fpinn-delta: fractional physics-informed neural networks for the inverse dynamics of a delta parallel robot"
abstract: "Jupyter notebooks that simulate a delta parallel robot with memory-dependent (Caputo) joint damping, train integer and fractional physics-informed neural networks for its inverse dynamics, and evaluate them open loop and with computed-torque control."
type: software
authors:
